gate.git.needs_approval:
The git command in this command changes the repository, so an agent cannot run it directly ({why}).
Command: {git_command}
Tell the user the whole command and the code {code}, and ask them to run `{command} approve-command` in their own terminal, read the command, then type the code. After the approval you may run the same command once more within {minutes} minutes (once only, spelled exactly the same). Do not change the spelling, and do not run approve-command yourself.
